{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不当官正好去录节目  (Free to Direct the Shoot in Person)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Just as the crew marches toward the building to protest, Chun Yuqiao walks out pulling a suitcase and stops everyone in their tracks. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这是要去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您拉着行李要去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去欧洲啊！我现在不是首席内容官了，但我还是制作一部的总制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在不当官了，正好有空跟你们一块儿去录魅力远航，欢迎吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "欢迎！不过我们刚刚不是要去造反吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就凭你哪敢造反呀，快上车出发吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，这件事连累你了，大伙儿心里都挺过意不去的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别多想，我能亲自去参与原创节目的录制，高兴还来不及呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三十七条军规，你知道你刚才违反了多少条吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，不好意思，我先接个电话。放心吧，淳于总已经找到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我想申请这次欧洲我就不去了，家里有点事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "而且我的论文还想再多改两遍，怕去了欧洲就没时间改了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想好了吗？批准。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这是要去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where are you all marching off to?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您拉着行李要去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, where are you heading with that suitcase?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去欧洲啊！我现在不是首席内容官了，但我还是制作一部的总制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To Europe! I may no longer be Chief Content Officer, yet I am still chief producer of Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在不当官了，正好有空跟你们一块儿去录魅力远航，欢迎吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that I hold no executive title, I finally have time to go film Charming Voyage with you—am I welcome?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "欢迎！不过我们刚刚不是要去造反吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome! Wait—were we not about to stage a mutiny just now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "就凭你哪敢造反呀，快上车出发吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As if you would dare mutiny—hurry aboard and let us set off!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，这件事连累你了，大伙儿心里都挺过意不去的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, this whole mess dragged you down, and everyone feels really bad about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别多想，我能亲自去参与原创节目的录制，高兴还来不及呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not overthink it; getting to join the filming of our original show in person makes me happier than I can say.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三十七条军规，你知道你刚才违反了多少条吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Out of our thirty-seven team rules, do you know how many you just broke?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，不好意思，我先接个电话。放心吧，淳于总已经找到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry, Chun Yuqiao, let me take a quick call—rest assured, we have found Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，我想申请这次欧洲我就不去了，家里有点事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao, I would like to request leave from this Europe trip because something came up at home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "而且我的论文还想再多改两遍，怕去了欧洲就没时间改了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, I want to revise my thesis a couple more times and worry I would lack time in Europe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想好了吗？批准。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you thought it through? Approved.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这是要去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，您拉着行李要去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "去欧洲啊！我现在不是首席内容官了，但我还是制作一部的总制作人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在不当官了，正好有空跟你们一块儿去录魅力远航，欢迎吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "欢迎！不过我们刚刚不是要去造反吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
